# db-service-api

This chart deploys the shared DB Service gateway components for the sharded databases reference architecture.

## Requirements

| Repository | Name | Version |
|------------|------|---------|
| file://../../../kxCharts/gw | gw | 0.1.0 |

## Configuration Options

Configuration for the local `gw` subchart is provided under the `gw` key. See the chart README under `referenceArchitectures/kxCharts/gw/` for the full local configuration table.
